{"4208890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Rays", "steam_appid": 4208890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4772700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack by a group of aliens controlled by a hivemind. If we destroy that, then the aliens will leave and Earth will be safe, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208890/extras/65eea150b83d44d1601f467786c43061.poster.avif?t=1780238484\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208890/extras/65eea150b83d44d1601f467786c43061.webm?t=1780238484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208890/extras/65eea150b83d44d1601f467786c43061.mp4?t=1780238484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Rays</strong> is a 2D platformer where you jump and shoot enemies and dodge their own attacks. Inspired by classic platformers from the 80s and 90s like Mega Man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Additional Weapons you can get which all have different effects and uses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Upgrades you can get which grant new abilities to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two separate paths you can take which lead to different levels, bosses and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 main game levels and 5 main game bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 extra levels and an extra boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Separate Difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush Mode</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack by a group of aliens con